      "lines": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "is summarized from the Mahâbhârata. I am indebted to",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "Professor Bhânḍârakar for drawing my attention to the story.",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 3,
          "text": "शिखरिणां गणाः. See the passage quoted in the note to St.",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 4,
          "text": "36; but I am not aware of any version of the story which",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 5,
          "text": "makes more than one mountain, the Mainâka, seek shelter",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 6,
          "text": "with the ocean. For वडवानलः see Matsya Purâṇa CLXXIV., 49",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 7,
          "text": "et seq., and particularly Stanza 58. संवर्तक. Some copies of the com-",
          "end": "hyphen"
        },
        {
          "n": 8,
          "text": "mentary say समस्तसंवर्तकाः परस्परं जलचरान्भक्षयन्ति, which I do not",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 9,
          "text": "understand. The संवर्तकाः are the Fires of Destruction. See",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 10,
          "text": "Muir’s Sanskṛit Texts V., 161. Also Matsya Purâṇa CLXV. 12.",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 11,
          "text": "CLXVI. 59. Râmarshi says of संवर्तक—सकलजलचरजीवविशेषः अथवा",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 12,
          "text": "समस्तकल्पान्तकालाग्निः. The point of the Stanza according to the",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 13,
          "text": "commentary is शरणागतानां दुष्टानामपि संरक्षणं सद्भिः क्रियते which is not",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 14,
          "text": "correct. The point is rather the immense capacity of great",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 15,
          "text": "personages. On शिखरिपत्रिणः which is Râmarshi’s reading he has",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 16,
          "text": "पर्वता एव पत्रिणः पक्षिणः; should it not be rather पर्वताः पत्रिण इव ?—Pṛithvî.",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 17,
          "text": "",
          "end": "space"
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": false,
      "note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "r4",
      "type": "stanza_note",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "St. LXXVII.—For the construction of this Stanza see Siddh.",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "Kaum. II., 295 and 296 and compare Mâgha I., 51 together",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 3,
          "text": "with Mallinâth’s commentary. With चेष्टितम् here will correspond",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 4,
          "text": "the चक्रे in Mâgha as the सामान्यवचन. I have rejected the read-",
          "end": "hyphen"
        },
        {
          "n": 5,
          "text": "ing लक्षणम्, as it would be a slight obstacle in the way of this",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 6,
          "text": "interpretation and as other interpretations of the meaning of",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 7,
          "text": "the imperative, associated with the words एतत्सतां चेष्टितम् or लक्षणम्,",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 8,
          "text": "are wanting in force and propriety. The commentary runs",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 9,
          "text": "thus सत्सङ्गः कर्तव्यस्तेन स्वहितं भवति इति शास्त्राणि ब्रुवन्ति. । अतः कारणात्सतां",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 10,
          "text": "चेष्टितं स्वयमाचरति तदेवोपदिशति तत्कथयति रे जन त्वं तृष्णां छिन्धि....इत्यादि सतां",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 11,
          "text": "स्वयमाचरितं इतरेषामुपदेशश्च ॥ Râmarshi says चेष्टितं चेष्टा इदमुपदेशवचन-",
          "end": "hyphen"
        },
        {
          "n": 12,
          "text": "मित्यर्थः.—S'ârdûlavikrîḍita.",
          "end": "space"
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": false,
      "note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "r5",
      "type": "stanza_note",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "St. LXXVIII.—कियन्तः = some few only. Comp. कश्चित् in Bha-",
          "end": "hyphen"
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "gavadgîtâ VII., 3 एतेन मनसा वाचा कर्मणा च सर्वेषामुपकारवन्त इत्यर्थः.",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 3,
          "text": "Râmarshi.—Mâlinî.",
          "end": "space"
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": false,
      "note": null
    },
